id: SAFE19-1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: ops_limit
target: crates/core/src/history_load.rs
find:     if env.ops.len() > MAX_HISTORY_OPS {
replace:     if env.ops.len() > MAX_HISTORY_OPS && env.ops.len() <= MAX_HISTORY_OPS * 2 {
expect-fail: tenfold_is_too_many_ops_within_a_second
note: 上限のすぐ上だけを断ち、桁違いに多い件数を素通りさせる
